{
    "name": "§6Betsy Kettleman",
    "entityType": "easy_npc:humanoid",
    "description": "A manipulative and entitled mother.",
    "skin": {
        "type": "URL_SKIN",
        "skinUrl": "https://s.namemc.com/i/78fde0361cbbfe8d.png"
    },
    "attributes": {
        "maxHealth": 40,
        "invulnerable": false,
        "attackableByPlayers": true,
        "attackableByMonsters": true,
        "nameVisibility": "NEVER"
    },
    "dialogs": {
        "main": {
            "greeting": "（她打量着你，眼神充满警惕）我们没什么好谈的。如果你是那个检察官派来的说客，现在就可以滚了。我们家克雷格是无辜的，是有人陷害他。",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "§6§l接受任务",
                    "action": "OPEN_QUEST_DIALOG:RANDOM_POOL:250a53f1-dcb3-40a2-ba32-c7bb4439487c,a400a414-6c30-48ce-9a03-3046c7e95978,a403b057-392c-4e64-a851-15c046c983ae,d61e2532-0871-43a0-893f-76950ed9f749,3adbd6ae-262f-4d77-863e-3f7e365dbbce",
                    "id": "btn_quest_0785288a"
                },
                {
                    "label": "我只是路过",
                    "action": "SHOW_dialog:talk_neighbor",
                    "id": "btn_neighbor"
                },
                {
                    "label": "关于那笔失踪的钱...",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:talk_money",
                    "id": "btn_money"
                },
                {
                    "label": "或许我能帮你们打官司",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:quest_intro",
                    "id": "btn_q"
                }
            ]
        },
        "talk_neighbor": {
            "greeting": "路过？这穷乡僻壤有什么好路过的。听我说，我们家以前在镇上也是有头有脸的，要不是那些小人嫉妒，我们也不会落到今天这个地步。",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "回主菜单",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:main",
                    "id": "btn_back"
                }
            ]
        },
        "talk_money": {
            "greeting": "钱！钱！钱！检察官就只知道钱！那是公款，我们一分都没动！那笔钱...（她突然收住）反正我们是清白的。你们这些外人根本不懂我们为了家庭付出了什么。",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "继续追问",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:talk_money_2",
                    "id": "btn追问"
                },
                {
                    "label": "回主菜单",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:main",
                    "id": "btn_back"
                }
            ]
        },
        "talk_money_2": {
            "greeting": "够了！我没什么好说的。克雷格，送客！（她朝屋里喊了一声，但没人回应）总之，别想从我这里套出任何话。我们有权利保持沉默。",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "回主菜单",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:main",
                    "id": "btn_back"
                }
            ]
        },
        "quest_intro": {
            "greeting": "你想帮我们打官司？哼，你看起来不像个律师，更像个骗子。不过...现在这时候，只要是能对付比尔·奥克利的人，我都可以考虑。你能保证把那个该死的检察官赶出我们的生活吗？",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "保证",
                    "action": "CLOSE_DIALOG",
                    "id": "btn_acc"
                },
                {
                    "label": "我尽力",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:main",
                    "id": "btn_back"
                }
            ]
        }
    },
    "pose": "STANDING",
    "drop": {
        "item": {
            "item": "numismatic-overhaul:bronze_coin,numismatic-overhaul:silver_coin",
            "count": 15
        },
